{"word":{"id":"new-hsk-3-0726","lang":"zh","lemma":"突出","display_form":"突出","pos":"unknown","rank":726,"pronunciation":"tūchū"},"glosses":{"primary_gloss":"prominent; stand out","secondary_glosses":["stand out"],"notes":"Used when a person, color, object, or problem is easy to notice because it stands out clearly."},"examples":[{"id":"new-hsk-3-0726-ex1","meaning_en":"stand out","sentence":"这张照片里，她的红衣服很突出。","translation":"In this photo, her red clothes stand out a lot.","difficulty":2,"source":"generator-3","is_primary":true},{"id":"new-hsk-3-0726-ex2","meaning_en":"prominent","sentence":"黑板上的红字最突出。","translation":"The red writing on the blackboard stands out the most.","difficulty":1,"source":"generator-3","is_primary":false},{"id":"new-hsk-3-0726-ex3","meaning_en":"prominent","sentence":"这家店门口的红灯很突出。","translation":"The red light at this shop's entrance is very eye-catching.","difficulty":1,"source":"generator-3","is_primary":false}],"example_translations":[{"example_id":"new-hsk-3-0726-ex1","translation":"In this photo, her red clothes stand out a lot."},{"example_id":"new-hsk-3-0726-ex2","translation":"The red writing on the blackboard stands out the most."},{"example_id":"new-hsk-3-0726-ex3","translation":"The red light at this shop's entrance is very eye-catching."}]}
{"word":{"id":"new-hsk-3-0727","lang":"zh","lemma":"突然","display_form":"突然","pos":"unknown","rank":727,"pronunciation":"tūrán"},"glosses":{"primary_gloss":"suddenly","secondary_glosses":["all of a sudden"],"notes":"Used when something happens quickly and unexpectedly."},"examples":[{"id":"new-hsk-3-0727-ex1","meaning_en":"suddenly","sentence":"天突然下雨了，我们跑进了店里。","translation":"It suddenly started raining, and we ran into a shop.","difficulty":1,"source":"generator-3","is_primary":true},{"id":"new-hsk-3-0727-ex2","meaning_en":"suddenly","sentence":"我正要睡觉，电话突然响了。","translation":"I was just about to sleep when the phone suddenly rang.","difficulty":1,"source":"generator-3","is_primary":false},{"id":"new-hsk-3-0727-ex3","meaning_en":"all of a sudden","sentence":"他走到门口，突然不说话了。","translation":"When he got to the door, he suddenly stopped talking.","difficulty":2,"source":"generator-3","is_primary":false}],"example_translations":[{"example_id":"new-hsk-3-0727-ex1","translation":"It suddenly started raining, and we ran into a shop."},{"example_id":"new-hsk-3-0727-ex2","translation":"I was just about to sleep when the phone suddenly rang."},{"example_id":"new-hsk-3-0727-ex3","translation":"When he got to the door, he suddenly stopped talking."}]}
{"word":{"id":"new-hsk-3-0728","lang":"zh","lemma":"图","display_form":"图","pos":"unknown","rank":728,"pronunciation":"tú picture;"},"glosses":{"primary_gloss":"picture; diagram","secondary_glosses":["chart"],"notes":"A short everyday word for a picture, diagram, or simple chart that you look at to understand something."},"examples":[{"id":"new-hsk-3-0728-ex1","meaning_en":"diagram","sentence":"老师在黑板上画了一张图。","translation":"The teacher drew a diagram on the blackboard.","difficulty":1,"source":"generator-3","is_primary":true},{"id":"new-hsk-3-0728-ex2","meaning_en":"picture","sentence":"这本书里的图很多。","translation":"This book has a lot of pictures in it.","difficulty":1,"source":"generator-3","is_primary":false},{"id":"new-hsk-3-0728-ex3","meaning_en":"chart","sentence":"我先看图，再看题目。","translation":"I look at the chart first, and then I read the question.","difficulty":1,"source":"generator-3","is_primary":false}],"example_translations":[{"example_id":"new-hsk-3-0728-ex1","translation":"The teacher drew a diagram on the blackboard."},{"example_id":"new-hsk-3-0728-ex2","translation":"This book has a lot of pictures in it."},{"example_id":"new-hsk-3-0728-ex3","translation":"I look at the chart first, and then I read the question."}]}
{"word":{"id":"new-hsk-3-0729","lang":"zh","lemma":"图画","display_form":"图画","pos":"unknown","rank":729,"pronunciation":"tú huà"},"glosses":{"primary_gloss":"drawing; picture","secondary_glosses":["painting"],"notes":"Usually refers to a drawing or picture that someone has made."},"examples":[{"id":"new-hsk-3-0729-ex1","meaning_en":"drawing","sentence":"妹妹下午在家画图画。","translation":"My younger sister draws pictures at home in the afternoon.","difficulty":1,"source":"generator-3","is_primary":true},{"id":"new-hsk-3-0729-ex2","meaning_en":"picture","sentence":"这张图画里有一只猫。","translation":"There is a cat in this picture.","difficulty":1,"source":"generator-3","is_primary":false},{"id":"new-hsk-3-0729-ex3","meaning_en":"drawing","sentence":"妹妹把图画给妈妈看。","translation":"My younger sister showed the drawing to Mom.","difficulty":1,"source":"generator-3","is_primary":false}],"example_translations":[{"example_id":"new-hsk-3-0729-ex1","translation":"My younger sister draws pictures at home in the afternoon."},{"example_id":"new-hsk-3-0729-ex2","translation":"There is a cat in this picture."},{"example_id":"new-hsk-3-0729-ex3","translation":"My younger sister showed the drawing to Mom."}]}
{"word":{"id":"new-hsk-3-0730","lang":"zh","lemma":"土","display_form":"土（名）","pos":"noun","rank":730,"pronunciation":"tǔ"},"glosses":{"primary_gloss":"soil; dirt","secondary_glosses":["earth","ground"],"notes":"The loose earth on the ground, especially the soil in a yard, garden, or field."},"examples":[{"id":"new-hsk-3-0730-ex1","meaning_en":"soil","sentence":"花园里的土很黑。","translation":"The soil in the garden is very dark.","difficulty":1,"source":"generator-3","is_primary":true},{"id":"new-hsk-3-0730-ex2","meaning_en":"dirt","sentence":"孩子跑回来，鞋上都是土。","translation":"The child ran back, and his shoes were covered in dirt.","difficulty":1,"source":"generator-3","is_primary":false},{"id":"new-hsk-3-0730-ex3","meaning_en":"soil","sentence":"妈妈种花以后，手上都是土。","translation":"After planting flowers, Mom's hands were covered in soil.","difficulty":1,"source":"generator-3","is_primary":false}],"example_translations":[{"example_id":"new-hsk-3-0730-ex1","translation":"The soil in the garden is very dark."},{"example_id":"new-hsk-3-0730-ex2","translation":"The child ran back, and his shoes were covered in dirt."},{"example_id":"new-hsk-3-0730-ex3","translation":"After planting flowers, Mom's hands were covered in soil."}]}
{"word":{"id":"new-hsk-3-0731","lang":"zh","lemma":"团","display_form":"团","pos":"unknown","rank":731,"pronunciation":"tuán"},"glosses":{"primary_gloss":"group","secondary_glosses":["organized group"],"notes":"Often refers to an organized group and is very common in group words such as 旅游团 and 代表团."},"examples":[{"id":"new-hsk-3-0731-ex1","meaning_en":"group","sentence":"门口来了一个旅游团。","translation":"A tour group arrived at the entrance.","difficulty":1,"source":"generator-3","is_primary":true},{"id":"new-hsk-3-0731-ex2","meaning_en":"group","sentence":"这个团明天早上出发。","translation":"This group is leaving tomorrow morning.","difficulty":1,"source":"generator-3","is_primary":false},{"id":"new-hsk-3-0731-ex3","meaning_en":"organized group","sentence":"我们学校今天来了一个代表团。","translation":"A delegation came to our school today.","difficulty":2,"source":"generator-3","is_primary":false}],"example_translations":[{"example_id":"new-hsk-3-0731-ex1","translation":"A tour group arrived at the entrance."},{"example_id":"new-hsk-3-0731-ex2","translation":"This group is leaving tomorrow morning."},{"example_id":"new-hsk-3-0731-ex3","translation":"A delegation came to our school today."}]}
{"word":{"id":"new-hsk-3-0732","lang":"zh","lemma":"团结","display_form":"团结","pos":"unknown","rank":732,"pronunciation":"tuánjié"},"glosses":{"primary_gloss":"united; unite","secondary_glosses":["stick together"],"notes":"Used when people support each other and work together as one group."},"examples":[{"id":"new-hsk-3-0732-ex1","meaning_en":"united","sentence":"我们班很团结。","translation":"Our class is very united.","difficulty":1,"source":"generator-3","is_primary":true},{"id":"new-hsk-3-0732-ex2","meaning_en":"stick together","sentence":"比赛前，队长说大家要团结。","translation":"Before the match, the team leader said everyone needed to stick together.","difficulty":1,"source":"generator-3","is_primary":false},{"id":"new-hsk-3-0732-ex3","meaning_en":"united","sentence":"一家人很团结，什么问题都不怕。","translation":"When a family is united, they are not afraid of any problem.","difficulty":2,"source":"generator-3","is_primary":false}],"example_translations":[{"example_id":"new-hsk-3-0732-ex1","translation":"Our class is very united."},{"example_id":"new-hsk-3-0732-ex2","translation":"Before the match, the team leader said everyone needed to stick together."},{"example_id":"new-hsk-3-0732-ex3","translation":"When a family is united, they are not afraid of any problem."}]}
{"word":{"id":"new-hsk-3-0733","lang":"zh","lemma":"团体","display_form":"团体","pos":"unknown","rank":733,"pronunciation":"tuántǐ"},"glosses":{"primary_gloss":"group; organization","secondary_glosses":[],"notes":"An organized group of people, such as a student group, club, or social organization."},"examples":[{"id":"new-hsk-3-0733-ex1","meaning_en":"group","sentence":"学校里有很多学生团体。","translation":"There are many student groups at school.","difficulty":2,"source":"generator-3","is_primary":true},{"id":"new-hsk-3-0733-ex2","meaning_en":"organization","sentence":"这个团体常去学校做活动。","translation":"This organization often goes to schools to hold activities.","difficulty":2,"source":"generator-3","is_primary":false},{"id":"new-hsk-3-0733-ex3","meaning_en":"group","sentence":"我想参加这个团体的活动。","translation":"I want to join this group's activities.","difficulty":1,"source":"generator-3","is_primary":false}],"example_translations":[{"example_id":"new-hsk-3-0733-ex1","translation":"There are many student groups at school."},{"example_id":"new-hsk-3-0733-ex2","translation":"This organization often goes to schools to hold activities."},{"example_id":"new-hsk-3-0733-ex3","translation":"I want to join this group's activities."}]}
{"word":{"id":"new-hsk-3-0734","lang":"zh","lemma":"推动","display_form":"推动","pos":"unknown","rank":734,"pronunciation":"tuī dòng"},"glosses":{"primary_gloss":"push; promote","secondary_glosses":["push forward"],"notes":"Can mean pushing something forward with force, and also helping a plan, activity, or work move ahead."},"examples":[{"id":"new-hsk-3-0734-ex1","meaning_en":"push","sentence":"他们一起推动小车进院子。","translation":"They pushed the small cart into the yard together.","difficulty":1,"source":"generator-3","is_primary":true},{"id":"new-hsk-3-0734-ex2","meaning_en":"push forward","sentence":"这次比赛推动了大家天天练习。","translation":"This competition pushed everyone to practice every day.","difficulty":2,"source":"generator-3","is_primary":false},{"id":"new-hsk-3-0734-ex3","meaning_en":"promote","sentence":"老师的话推动他继续努力。","translation":"The teacher's words encouraged him to keep working hard.","difficulty":2,"source":"generator-3","is_primary":false}],"example_translations":[{"example_id":"new-hsk-3-0734-ex1","translation":"They pushed the small cart into the yard together."},{"example_id":"new-hsk-3-0734-ex2","translation":"This competition pushed everyone to practice every day."},{"example_id":"new-hsk-3-0734-ex3","translation":"The teacher's words encouraged him to keep working hard."}]}
{"word":{"id":"new-hsk-3-0735","lang":"zh","lemma":"推广","display_form":"推广","pos":"unknown","rank":735,"pronunciation":"tuīguǎng"},"glosses":{"primary_gloss":"promote; popularize","secondary_glosses":["spread"],"notes":"Used when people try to spread an idea, product, or method so more people use it."},"examples":[{"id":"new-hsk-3-0735-ex1","meaning_en":"promote","sentence":"老师想在班里推广这个办法。","translation":"The teacher wants to promote this method in the class.","difficulty":1,"source":"generator-3","is_primary":true},{"id":"new-hsk-3-0735-ex2","meaning_en":"promote","sentence":"这家店最近在推广新菜。","translation":"This restaurant has been promoting new dishes lately.","difficulty":2,"source":"generator-3","is_primary":false},{"id":"new-hsk-3-0735-ex3","meaning_en":"popularize","sentence":"这个办法很方便，大家都想推广。","translation":"This method is very convenient, so everyone wants to spread it.","difficulty":2,"source":"generator-3","is_primary":false}],"example_translations":[{"example_id":"new-hsk-3-0735-ex1","translation":"The teacher wants to promote this method in the class."},{"example_id":"new-hsk-3-0735-ex2","translation":"This restaurant has been promoting new dishes lately."},{"example_id":"new-hsk-3-0735-ex3","translation":"This method is very convenient, so everyone wants to spread it."}]}
{"word":{"id":"new-hsk-3-0736","lang":"zh","lemma":"推进","display_form":"推进","pos":"unknown","rank":736,"pronunciation":"tuī jìn advance;"},"glosses":{"primary_gloss":"advance; push forward","secondary_glosses":[],"notes":"Used when something is moved forward physically or when a plan or piece of work keeps progressing."},"examples":[{"id":"new-hsk-3-0736-ex1","meaning_en":"push forward","sentence":"两个人把桌子推进教室里。","translation":"Two people pushed the desk into the classroom.","difficulty":1,"source":"generator-3","is_primary":true},{"id":"new-hsk-3-0736-ex2","meaning_en":"advance","sentence":"这个计划正在一步一步推进。","translation":"This plan is moving forward step by step.","difficulty":2,"source":"generator-3","is_primary":false},{"id":"new-hsk-3-0736-ex3","meaning_en":"advance","sentence":"工作太多，今天只推进了一半。","translation":"There was too much work, so today we only moved half of it forward.","difficulty":2,"source":"generator-3","is_primary":false}],"example_translations":[{"example_id":"new-hsk-3-0736-ex1","translation":"Two people pushed the desk into the classroom."},{"example_id":"new-hsk-3-0736-ex2","translation":"This plan is moving forward step by step."},{"example_id":"new-hsk-3-0736-ex3","translation":"There was too much work, so today we only moved half of it forward."}]}
{"word":{"id":"new-hsk-3-0737","lang":"zh","lemma":"推开","display_form":"推开","pos":"unknown","rank":737,"pronunciation":"tuī kāi"},"glosses":{"primary_gloss":"push open","secondary_glosses":["push aside"],"notes":"Usually means pushing a door, window, or object so it opens or moves away."},"examples":[{"id":"new-hsk-3-0737-ex1","meaning_en":"push open","sentence":"他轻轻推开门，走了进去。","translation":"He gently pushed the door open and walked in.","difficulty":1,"source":"generator-3","is_primary":true},{"id":"new-hsk-3-0737-ex2","meaning_en":"push open","sentence":"妈妈推开门，让风进来。","translation":"Mom pushed the door open and let the wind come in.","difficulty":1,"source":"generator-3","is_primary":false},{"id":"new-hsk-3-0737-ex3","meaning_en":"push aside","sentence":"她把椅子推开，坐在妈妈旁边。","translation":"She pushed the chair aside and sat next to Mom.","difficulty":2,"source":"generator-3","is_primary":false}],"example_translations":[{"example_id":"new-hsk-3-0737-ex1","translation":"He gently pushed the door open and walked in."},{"example_id":"new-hsk-3-0737-ex2","translation":"Mom pushed the door open and let the wind come in."},{"example_id":"new-hsk-3-0737-ex3","translation":"She pushed the chair aside and sat next to Mom."}]}
